de-map",{"title":191,"path":192,"stem":193,"icon":194},"Les applications","\u002Ffr\u002Finternals\u002Fapps","fr\u002F7.internals\u002F2.apps","i-lucide-boxes",{"title":196,"path":197,"stem":198,"icon":132},"Appels et confiance","\u002Ffr\u002Finternals\u002Finterop","fr\u002F7.internals\u002F3.interop",{"title":200,"path":201,"stem":202,"icon":203},"Flux","\u002Ffr\u002Finternals\u002Fflows","fr\u002F7.internals\u002F4.flows","i-lucide-route",{"title":205,"path":206,"stem":207,"icon":38},"Dans un serveur client","\u002Ffr\u002Finternals\u002Fcustomer-server","fr\u002F7.internals\u002F5.customer-server",{"title":209,"path":210,"stem":211,"icon":117},"Notes pour Wolf","\u002Ffr\u002Finternals\u002Fwolf","fr\u002F7.internals\u002F6.wolf",{"id":213,"title":188,"body":214,"description":772,"extension":773,"links":774,"meta":775,"navigation":776,"path":184,"seo":777,"stem":185,"__hash__":778},"docs_fr\u002Ffr\u002F7.internals\u002F1.index.md",{"type":215,"value":216,"toc":762},"minimark",[217,239,254,259,286,290,358,362,545,603,606,610,729,733],[218,219,220],"note",{},[221,222,223,224,228,229,233,234,238],"p",{},"Cette section est non répertoriée : elle a une adresse, mais elle n'est ni dans le menu latéral, ni dans la recherche, ni dans ",[225,226,227],"code",{},"llms.txt",", et elle demande aux moteurs de recherche de ne pas l'indexer. Elle n'est pas privée. C'est l'analyse de travail de Dokos sur le logiciel de quelqu'un d'autre, lue dans des dépôts publics le ",[230,231,232],"strong",{},"19 novembre 2026",". Rien ici n'a été vérifié sur un serveur Frappe Cloud v2 en fonctionnement. Quand les documents des dépôts et leur code se contredisent, c'est le code qui est rapporté, et l'écart est listé dans ",[235,236,209],"a",{"href":237},"\u002Ffr\u002Finternals\u002Fwolf#l%C3%A0-o%C3%B9-les-documents-sont-en-retard-sur-le-code",".",[221,240,241,242,248,249,238],{},"Depuis ",[235,243,247],{"href":244,"rel":245},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fbthuner\u002Fdodock-wolf\u002Fissues\u002F136",[246],"nofollow","#136",", Wolf se construit à côté de Frappe Cloud v2, pas par-dessus. Cette section dit ce qu'est ce terrain. La version illustrée est le ",[235,250,253],{"href":251,"rel":252},"https:\u002F\u002Fbthuner.github.io\u002Fdodock-wolf\u002Fmaking-on\u002F",[246],"making-on",[255,256,258],"h2",{"id":257},"en-un-paragraphe","En un paragraphe",[221,260,261,262,265,266,269,270,273,274,277,278,281,282,285],{},"Frappe Cloud v2, ce sont six applications. ",[230,263,264],{},"Central"," est un site Frappe global unique : les équipes, la facturation, la console. Chaque région a un ",[230,267,268],{},"Atlas"," (un site Frappe qui fait tourner des machines virtuelles Firecracker sur des hôtes physiques, avec un proxy devant) et un ",[230,271,272],{},"Cargo"," (un site Frappe qui construit les images, fait tourner le stockage S3 et fait tourner le magasin de télémétrie de la région). ",[230,275,276],{},"Datum"," est l'API d'écriture de ce magasin, devant ClickHouse. ",[230,279,280],{},"Beacon"," est un site Frappe global unique qui lit le ClickHouse de chaque région et appelle l'astreinte. Un serveur client est une machine virtuelle qui fait tourner ",[230,283,284],{},"Pilot",", lequel gère le bench et ses sites. Les applications ne partagent jamais de base de données : elles se parlent en HTTPS, avec des jetons Ed25519 de courte durée, des webhooks signés par HMAC et le service de métadonnées de la machine virtuelle.",[255,287,289],{"id":288},"trois-plans","Trois plans",[291,292,293,312],"table",{},[294,295,296],"thead",{},[297,298,299,303,306,309],"tr",{},[300,301,302],"th",{},"Plan",[300,304,305],{},"Combien",[300,307,308],{},"Applications",[300,310,311],{},"Possède",[313,314,315,330,344],"tbody",{},[297,316,317,321,324,327],{},[318,319,320],"td",{},"Global",[318,322,323],{},"un site chacune",[318,325,326],{},"Central, Beacon",[318,328,329],{},"Les équipes, les capacités, la facturation, la console ; les incidents, les niveaux de service, les appels d'astreinte, la page de statut",[297,331,332,335,338,341],{},[318,333,334],{},"Région",[318,336,337],{},"un de chaque par région",[318,339,340],{},"Atlas, Cargo, Datum + ClickHouse, le proxy, la passerelle WireGuard, Garage (S3)",[318,342,343],{},"Les hôtes et les machines virtuelles, les réseaux, les routes et le certificat générique (wildcard) ; les images, les buckets ; la télémétrie",[297,345,346,349,352,355],{},[318,347,348],{},"Serveur",[318,350,351],{},"une machine virtuelle par serveur client",[318,353,354],{},"Pilot, le bench, les sites, MariaDB, Redis, nginx",[318,356,357],{},"Les applications, les sites, les sauvegardes, les mises à jour, les certificats des domaines personnalisés, tous les journaux",[255,359,361],{"id":360},"ce-qui-a-été-lu","Ce qui a été lu",[291,363,364,386],{},[294,365,366],{},[297,367,368,371,374,377,380,383],{},[300,369,370],{},"Dépôt",[300,372,373],{},"Commit",[300,375,376],{},"Ce que c'est",[300,378,379],{},"Technologies",[300,381,382],{},"Version",[300,384,385],{},"Licence",[313,387,388,414,446,472,497,522],{},[297,389,390,397,402,405,408,411],{},[318,391,392],{},[235,393,396],{"href":394,"rel":395},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Ffrappe\u002Fcentral",[246],"frappe\u002Fcentral",[318,398,399],{},[225,400,401],{},"5027a0c",[318,403,404],{},"Plan de contrôle et console",[318,406,407],{},"Application Frappe 16 + Vue",[318,409,410],{},"0.2.0",[318,412,413],{},"AGPL-3.0",[297,415,416,423,428,431,438,444],{},[318,417,418],{},[235,419,422],{"href":420,"rel":421},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Ffrappe\u002Fatlas",[246],"frappe\u002Fatlas",[318,424,425],{},[225,426,427],{},"31aa231",[318,429,430],{},"Gestionnaire de machines virtuelles d'une région",[318,432,433,434,437],{},"Application Frappe 16 + démon Go (",[225,435,436],{},"metald",") + proxy OpenResty + eBPF",[318,439,440,441,443],{},"0.0.1 (application), 0.1.0 (",[225,442,436],{},")",[318,445,413],{},[297,447,448,455,460,463,466,469],{},[318,449,450],{},[235,451,454],{